  'ultimate-beauty-tools-guide-glowing-skin',
  'LED masks, microcurrent devices and ice rollers — a no-nonsense guide to which premium beauty tools are actually worth it.',
  '<p>The at-home beauty tech market exploded in 2025 and shows no signs of slowing down. Our team tested dozens of devices to bring you the ones that actually deliver visible results.</p><h2>LED Light Therapy Masks</h2><p>Red light boosts collagen, blue light fights breakouts. Look for FDA-cleared devices with at least 100 LEDs per panel.</p><h2>Microcurrent Devices</h2><p>Often called the "5-minute facelift" — these gently tone facial muscles. Daily 5-minute sessions give the best results.</p><h2>Ice Rollers & Cryotherapy Wands</h2><p>The simplest, most affordable category. Great for de-puffing and prepping skin for serums.</p><p>Explore all our editor picks in the <a href="/categories/beauty">Beauty collection</a>.</p>',
