(
  '5 Fashion Accessories That Instantly Elevate Any Outfit',
  '5-fashion-accessories-elevate-outfit',
  'A sharp watch, a structured bag, the right sunglasses — small choices that completely transform how an outfit reads.',
  '<p>You do not need a new wardrobe to look polished. The right accessory pieces, chosen carefully and worn repeatedly, do more than a closet of fast fashion ever could.</p><h2>1. A Quality Watch</h2><p>Mechanical or quartz, leather strap or steel bracelet — the key is wearing it consistently. Treat it as part of your daily uniform.</p><h2>2. Structured Leather Bag</h2><p>One bag in a neutral tone (black, cognac or navy) outperforms three trend-driven pieces.</p><h2>3. Sunglasses with Real UV Protection</h2><p>Acetate frames in a classic silhouette — wayfarer, aviator or round — never go out of style.</p><h2>4. A Silk Scarf</h2><p>Around the neck, tied to a bag handle, or as a hair accessory. Endlessly versatile.</p><h2>5. Statement Belt</h2><p>A well-made belt anchors any look. Invest once, wear daily.</p><p>Shop curated picks in our <a href="/categories/fashion">Fashion collection</a>.</p>',
  true,
